### Bottom line

Choosing between a transactional outbox and CDC hinges on the trade‑off you’re willing to make between consistency guarantees, latency, and operational overhead. By documenting these lessons early, teams can align their event‑ingestion strategy with the real‑world constraints of their domain and infrastructure.
